nContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.03666738420724869}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.03163600340485573}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "Updates", "type": "dataset-implicit", "dataset-implicit": {"rawForm": "Updates", "normalizedForm": "Updates", "offsetStart": 0, "offsetEnd": 7, "bestDataType": "tabular data", "bestTypeScore": 0.0238, "hasDataset": 0.7249109148979187, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 4, "x": 507.121, "y": 366.034, "w": 32.7173, "h": 12.005}]}, "normalizedForm": "Updates", "context": "Updates to this location and size information are received as map tasks are completed.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8673623204231262}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.04743678495287895}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.08520103991031647}}}, {"rawForm": "size", "type": "dataset-implicit", "dataset-implicit": {"rawForm": "size", "normalizedForm": "size", "offsetStart": 30, "offsetEnd": 34, "bestDataType": "tabular data", "bestTypeScore": 0.0238, "hasDataset": 0.7249109148979187, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 4, "x": 393.747, "y": 377.914, "w": 15.462, "h": 12.005}]}, "normalizedForm": "size", "context": "Updates to this location and size information are received as map tasks are completed.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8673623204231262}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.04743678495287895}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.08520103991031647}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 10, "offsetEnd": 27, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 4, "x": 354.078, "y": 453.514, "w": 77.18880000000001, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "Since the MapReduce library is designed to help process very large amounts of data using hundreds or thousands of machines, the library must tolerate machine failures gracefully.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.031515028327703476}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9428707361221313}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.025614280253648758}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 50, "offsetEnd": 67, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 6, "x": 461.251, "y": 156.394, "w": 78.74879999999996, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "To support situations like this, the user of the MapReduce library can provide a special partitioning function.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.16899681091308594}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7359476089477539}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.09505565464496613}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 82, "offsetEnd": 99, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 6, "x": 442.048, "y": 565.594, "w": 77.54880000000003, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "The only difference between a reduce function and a combiner function is how the MapReduce library han- dles the output of the function.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.46982231736183167}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.42736297845840454}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.1028146892786026}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 4, "offsetEnd": 21, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 6, "x": 333.099, "y": 698.794, "w": 77.42780000000005, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "The MapReduce library provides support for reading in- put data in several different formats.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.2493753433227539}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.5370890498161316}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2135355919599533}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 53, "offsetEnd": 70, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 131.213, "y": 624.994, "w": 77.18880000000001, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "We provide an optional mode of execu- tion where the MapReduce library detects which records cause deterministic crashes and skips these records in or- der to make forward progress.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.008031888864934444}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9904693961143494}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0014986916212365031}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapRe-\\nduce", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapRe-\nduce", "normalizedForm": "MapRe- duce", "offsetStart": 53, "offsetEnd": 64, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 264.128, "y": 686.914, "w": 32.727300000000014, "h": 12.004999999999995}, {"p": 7, "x": 71.9995, "y": 698.794, "w": 18.929, "h": 12.005}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapRe- duce", "context": "Before invoking a user Map or Reduce operation, the MapRe- duce library stores the sequence number of the argument in a global variable.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8797511458396912}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.09949693083763123}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02075178734958172}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.8797511458396912}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.09949693083763123}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02075178734958172}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 124, "offsetEnd": 141, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 394.705, "y": 259.354, "w": 77.30880000000002, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "To help facilitate debugging, profiling, and small-scale testing, we have developed an alternative im- plementation of the MapReduce library that sequentially executes all of the work for a MapReduce operation on the local machine.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.000934044539462775}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0021182456985116005}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 4, "offsetEnd": 21, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 7, "x": 334.782, "y": 635.914, "w": 79.22880000000004, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "The MapReduce library provides a counter facility to count occurrences of various events.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.22449682652950287}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.6538243293762207}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.12167879939079285}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "GetCounter", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "GetCounter", "normalizedForm": "GetCounter", "offsetStart": 33, "offsetEnd": 43, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 8, "x": 147.337, "y": 85.6083, "w": 53.9775, "h": 9.612}]}, "normalizedForm": "GetCounter", "context": "Counter* uppercase; uppercase = GetCounter(\\\"uppercase\\\");  map(String name, String contents):", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9642152190208435}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.015276642516255379}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02050809934735298}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9642152190208435}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.015276642516255379}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02050809934735298}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 57, "offsetEnd": 74, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 8, "x": 102.444, "y": 335.674, "w": 77.19935, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "Some counter values are automatically maintained by the MapReduce library, such as the number of in- put key/value pairs processed and the number of output key/value pairs produced.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.903685986995697}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.06723868101835251}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.029075322672724724}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "normalizedForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "offsetStart": 35, "offsetEnd": 53, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 8, "x": 329.621, "y": 672.634, "w": 81.26190000000003, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "context": "This program is modeled after the TeraSort benchmark .", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.7650881409645081}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.20507025718688965}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02984164096415043}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.980194628238678}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.20507025718688965}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02984164096415043}}, "references": [{"label": "[10]", "normalizedForm": "[10]", "refKey": 9, "offsetStart": 35020, "offsetEnd": 35024, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 8, "x": 412.923, "y": 672.634, "w": 15.334160000000054, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}]}, {"rawForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "normalizedForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "offsetStart": 77, "offsetEnd": 95, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 9, "x": 435.45, "y": 554.914, "w": 81.26190000000003, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "TeraSort benchmark", "context": "This is similar to the current best reported result of 1057 seconds for the TeraSort benchmark .", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.980194628238678}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.009534940123558044}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.01027037762105465}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.980194628238678}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.20507025718688965}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.02984164096415043}}, "references": [{"label": "[18]", "normalizedForm": "[18]", "refKey": 17, "offsetStart": 38601, "offsetEnd": 38605, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 9, "x": 518.751, "y": 554.914, "w": 15.334159999999997, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}]}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 34, "offsetEnd": 51, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 10, "x": 207.831, "y": 449.074, "w": 78.14780000000005, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "We wrote the first version of the MapReduce library in February of 2003, and made significant enhancements to it in August of 2003, including the locality optimization, dynamic load balancing of task execution across worker machines, etc.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.042140427976846695}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9530883431434631}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0047711823135614395}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 28, "offsetEnd": 45, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 10, "x": 441.228, "y": 608.914, "w": 78.50880000000001, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "At the end of each job, the MapReduce library logs statistics about the computational resources used by the job.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.6538176536560059}, "created": {"value": false, "score": 0.29211142659187317}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.0540708564221859}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 174, "offsetEnd": 191, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 11, "x": 137.718, "y": 236.314, "w": 77.31935000000001, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 The indexing code is simpler, smaller, and easier to understand, because the code that deals with fault tolerance, distribution and parallelization is hidden within the MapReduce library.", "mentionContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": false, "score": 0.17596815526485443}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.7125393152236938}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.11149252206087112}}, "documentContextAttributes": {"used": {"value": true, "score": 0.9316965937614441}, "created": {"value": true, "score": 0.9969476461410522}, "shared": {"value": false, "score": 0.2730671763420105}}}, {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "type": "dataset-name", "dataset-name": {"rawForm": "MapReduce library", "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "offsetStart": 25, "offsetEnd": 42, "boundingBoxes": [{"p": 11, "x": 188.154, "y": 303.034, "w": 77.30880000000002, "h": 12.004999999999995}]}, "normalizedForm": "MapReduce library", "context": "\u00e2\u0080\u00a2 The performance of the MapReduce library is good enough that we can keep conceptually unrelated computations separate, instead of mixing them to- gether to avoid extra passes over